        <h1>How to schedule SQL Server Express backups without SQL Server Agent</h1>
        <p class="lead">SQL Server Express is free and capable, but it ships without SQL Server Agent &mdash; so there is no built-in way to run backups on a schedule. Here is how to get automatic, verified and off-site SQL Server Express backups anyway.</p>
